# Everything the image does not need, and two things it must never contain.
#
# `data/` holds a household's calendar and the key that decrypts their feed
# addresses; `.env` holds whatever they put in it. Neither belongs in a layer
# that gets pushed to a public registry.
data/
**/.secret
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git/
.github/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
docs/
*.md
!README.md
.DS_Store
